   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2018 we provided a $15 million loan to NMB to allow it to grow its lending to key sectors of the Nepalese economy, including infrastructure, agriculture and tourism. This facility was repaid in full on maturity.In 2022, we followed-up with a senior loan of $25 million to the bank to be directed towards its selected climate finance assets.</narrative>
